428 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 269 0 R/E(Special political missions are generally financed through the UN regular budget. For delegates, the practical lesson is that a Council resolution should not simply authorize an ambitious mechanism: it should identify the implementing actor, reporting structure, personnel or technical capacity required, and a realistic funding pathway.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[16]>>
endobj

