1179 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 287 0 R/E(Structure action in layers: immediate civilian protection and de-escalation; a political process; monitoring and verification; resources and implementation; then transition or exit.)/Pg 32 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

1180 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 287 0 R/E(humanitarian actors, accessible points of contact for questions about a specific transaction or partner, and periodic review of whether the exemption is functioning as intended on the ground.)/Pg 32 0 R/K[11]>>
